# Hand-written public Kotlin types of the Android AAR and the JVM jar, with their public members
# (scripts/check-binding-api.sh, "Host-type lists"; ADR 0071 §5). The kotlin mode fails on any
# hand-written public type or member not listed here, and on a listed one the sources lack.
#
#   type <Name>      a public type
#     member <name>  one of its public members (fun, val, var, constructor, nested type)
#
# Adding a type is a review decision, like an inventory change.

# The Android Keystore platform key, in the AAR only (feature 0025 T04; ADR 0072 §2). The
# PlatformKey methods, toString, and the nested option and level types (their own members are
# not listed).
type AndroidKeystoreKey
  member generate
  member open
  member delete
  member publicJwk
  member algorithms
  member sign
  member agree
  member decryptKey
  member securityLevel
  member toString
  member StrongBox
  member SecurityLevel
  member UserAuthentication

# The per-use authentication hook and its BiometricPrompt implementation (ADR 0072 §4).
type PlatformKeyAuthorizer
  member authorize

type BiometricPromptAuthorizer
  member constructor
  member authorize
